          "value": "Installed at `~/.claude/skills/hallmark`. Red Agent has no Skill tool, so it reads Hallmark's files directly. Hallmark is user-installed and not part of this package, so the generated page must not depend on it at run time. Its floor rules are encoded as tests in assignment 4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:4",
      "name": "Charting guidance (donut, meters, contrast)",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "use-existing-skill:dataviz"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "Palette and contrast method for the five Agent colours; Red Agent applies its rules, Yellow Agent verifies contrast numerically"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:5",
      "name": "Report-flow integration across four CLIs",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "covered"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "api-integration -> blue-agent; edits only `src/`, using the existing placeholders"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:6",
      "name": "Zero-network and HTML-validity tests",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "covered"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "test-authoring -> yellow-agent; stdlib `html.parser` and `unittest`, no new dependency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:7",
      "name": "Security review of generated HTML and the CLI",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "covered"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "security-review -> yellow-agent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:8",
      "name": "Headless browser measurement at 375/768/1440/3840",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "covered"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "test-authoring -> yellow-agent via Bash; precondition: Chrome or Edge present (both found on this machine, Green confirms)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:9",
      "name": "Live in-browser check of the dashboard",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "use-existing-skill:browser-actions"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "Registry entry `live-browser-action` is `conditional`: it counts as covered only with per-site user approval, which is not given yet. Optional; the headless run above is the primary check"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:10",
      "name": "Current documentation for CSP, SVG and `<details>` behaviour",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "use-existing-skill:context7-mcp"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "Agents query Context7 before relying on browser behaviour from memory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:11",
      "name": "Version bump and dist regeneration",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "covered"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "code-implementation -> red-agent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:12",
      "name": "Registry record and Maturity & Progress Summary",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "use-existing-skill:mission-report"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "mission-report-authoring and maturity-scoring -> black-agent; requires this plan (met once written) and Agent reports"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:gap:13",
      "name": "Font embedding (Geist Mono / JetBrains Mono files)",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "status",
          "value": "needs-new-skill"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "notes",
          "value": "No registry action for subsetting and base64-embedding fonts. Not needed for this mission because the fonts are stacks with system fallbacks (decision 5); proposed only if you want exact typography on machines without those fonts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:1",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "Python 3.9 incompatibility in the new script (the 1.1.0 mission lost a CI round to exactly this)",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "technical"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "M"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Standard library only, no `match`, no `X | Y` type unions, no `str.removeprefix`; the report tests run on the full 3.9–3.12 CI matrix; Red Agent runs the suite under 3.9 before reporting."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:2",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "Agent-written text, file names or mission titles carry HTML or script into the dashboard",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "technical"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "H"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "`html.escape` on every string in both element and attribute contexts, a CSP with hash-pinned inline script and `default-src 'none'`, escaping tests with hostile fixtures, and a Yellow Agent security review."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:3",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "The page quietly gains an external reference, such as a font link or an image URL in a result string",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "technical"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "H"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "The CSP blocks it at run time, a static scan test fails the build, and the headless net log in assignment 5 must show 0 requests."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:4",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "The Black Agent segment and low-contrast text are unreadable on `#0a0c10`",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "technical"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "M"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Black is rendered light grey; contrast ratios are computed in tests (≥ 4.5 for text, ≥ 3 for chart colours); segments are directly labelled."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:5",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "The new script is missing from some CLI's `dist/` or is path-transformed, so the report flow breaks on Codex, Antigravity or OpenCode",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "integration"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "H"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Green Agent confirms how skill `scripts/` are copied; assignment 3 checks the command in all four targets; assignment 4 asserts the file exists in every target."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:6",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "Black Agent's report flow regresses, for example a render failure blocks the Markdown and JSON-LD reports",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "integration"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "M"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Order is fixed: Markdown, JSON-LD and validation first, then metrics, then HTML. A render failure is reported as a defect, and the two existing documents are already on disk."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:7",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "The metrics file has no reliable source for tests passed or duration, so the dashboard shows blanks",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "integration"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "M"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Start time recorded at \"go\", test counts copied from Yellow Agent's report through repeated `--test` flags, \"Not recorded\" when absent; never a default of zero."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:8",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "Widening Black Agent's write rule weakens the \"mission documents only\" guard",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "integration"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "L"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Only `mission-report.html` and `mission-metrics.json` are added, both in the mission directory; the guard is unchanged and Green Agent confirms it does not block them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:9",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "A Chart.js, Tailwind or Google Fonts dependency creeps in, or the page grows into a framework",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "scope"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "M"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Out of scope; the zero-dependency rule is tested, the size budget is 150 KB, and JavaScript is limited to the copy button."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:10",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "The request's capitalised badge, dotted meta string or invented sample figures conflict with Hallmark and get built anyway",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "scope"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "M"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Settled in decisions 1 and 2 above; Yellow Agent's Hallmark-floor tests encode the rules so they cannot be skipped."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:11",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "The version bump leaves the npx and uvx wrappers on 1.1.0 so they download 1.1.0 content without the dashboard",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "scope"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "M"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "Assignment 6 bumps every declared version, including both installer packages; `tests/installer` is re-run."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:12",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "Regenerating `dist/` overwrites hand edits or unrelated changes",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "data-loss"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "L"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "`dist/` is generated only; `build.py --check` before and after; the working tree is clean at plan time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:13",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "The registry is credited with an autonomy unlock the run history does not support",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "data-loss"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "L"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "The dashboard reads the existing gate verdict from `maturity.py`; it computes nothing itself."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Thing",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:mission-analytics-dashboard-v1-2-0:risk:14",
      "additionalType": "Risk",
      "name": "Headless Chrome network logging or the `file://` clipboard behaves differently from a hosted page",
      "additionalProperty": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "category",
          "value": "technical"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "severity",
          "value": "L"
        },
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
          "name": "mitigation",
          "value": "The copy handler falls back to `document.execCommand(\"copy\")`; assignment 5 records the actual result, and any gap is reported rather than hidden."
        }
      ]
    },
